{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4ab8c25e457046eda369af3744266217e774b1d95ffb581114945914c6d0cf0a", "ja": "！？　この声は……\nレッスンルームの方からか？", "zh": "！？这个声音是……从练习室那边传来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1006_se", "source_sha256": "d2ce5bddb50039d89e5488d48a8bb711f8f640c62322ddd4fb840a5759d06006", "ja": "バタバタ、バタン！", "zh": "扑通、砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1d7a6c5bdaf1cf8e2693f53980fe6e992e1b8dab9962f0756560969f489fab18", "ja": "どうした、みんな！\n何かあったのか！？", "zh": "怎么了，大家！\n出什么事了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "b75537f61d29a05d5c60466a6d75f3edf3f8f946368fa23a9f41e8d32c34ab6d", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}、大変！\nアミが、大人になっちゃうヨ～！？", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，不好啦！\n亚美要变成大人了哟～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "b5be08b880cad60cb5fce33a95a654b7c24b7869a938b8bf3afd2c8982ac8f82", "ja": "んっふっふ～ん、あっはっは～ん……♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～嗯，啊哈哈～嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1010_p", "source_sha256": "68dadefb14d6f3604f77d4ea4f31f8ca506ec5596b4d90309fa441bef4cab72e", "ja": "えっ……どういう状況だ？", "zh": "诶……这是什么情况？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "c6ac3903a5861f01c29c2bb3c5ae21f1e12a5310a7f43e575df9dbd2e1ba22de", "ja": "んもー。みんなも兄ちゃんも、\nちょっと驚きすぎじゃない？", "zh": "真是的～大家还有老哥，\n是不是也太惊讶了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6a8fc5abd85d7ef19473f720bc0c3817cca73b895facd7d3f34c22e826f2e18", "ja": "だって亜美だよ？　こんなこと、えーと、\nニッチなお茶漬けでもおかしくないっしょ！", "zh": "毕竟是亚美嘛？这种事，就算是……呃，冷门的茶泡饭，也没什么好奇怪的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d98b9cd5b19ca7d8cb11ff61d7ddac3ae122ed823e19ebe209fe651fba55c390", "ja": "日常茶飯事の事か？\nそれより、何があったんだ。", "zh": "这是家常便饭吗？\n比起这个，到底发生什么事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "1da3d29645e200d67e66edf9791e15ae1b2522f16851d5b128a68f78ee0dd4cb", "ja": "んっふっふ～。実はね～……\n亜美、今日クラスの男子に告白されたんだ～！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～其实呢～……\n亜美今天被班上的男生告白了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b0473ba98a9429dffeb8a7e79c8e94859ed91c8d9580133bb5abbdd6385e265c", "ja": "えっ、告白！？　亜美が、本当に……？", "zh": "咦，告白！？亚美她，真的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "f2e6b1c9bbf0dead12ce78afd37b6ffad0b6e46cec7baab0da8a96537988af55", "ja": "本当だってば！　亜美のせくしーも、\nついにここまで来たってことだよ！", "zh": "都说是真的啦！这就说明，亚美的性感魅力终于达到这种程度了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c089d60f6017d581db2ae5f08ec3d86b084cf1ba7a81ce4e18cb924c7b78b561", "ja": "そ、それで、どんなふうに言われたの？\nシチュエーションっていうか……。", "zh": "那、那后来对方是怎么说的？\n我是指当时的情形……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "cdebf55a807b3f659b6e38f2a7cdb58941bcf20e34cb9ec8bc7bfede10b5ad78", "ja": "えっと、授業の後に声かけられて。\n「放課後、校舎裏に来てほしい」って言われて。", "zh": "那个，放学后有人来找我。\n说是“放学后，希望你能来教学楼后面”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "94250ca2dc655472e345632e649da8ee2e183ccb929894558f973a377840bb95", "ja": "ほ、放課後の校舎裏に、\n男の子とふたりきり……！？", "zh": "放、放学后的校舍后面，和男孩子两个人独处……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "6f1dae1f395f54e99df6a381e036e8f2c17f28e68474f3cd0c76ad28b7f2b71a", "ja": "な、なんか生々しい……！", "zh": "总、总觉得好真实……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6d02fcdc45c57d6fab51f2884dd98d400f5a075b23029b4ee886ed3a1e144e3", "ja": "んで、ひとりで行ったら、その子が待ってたんだー。\n細かいトコは教えられないけどね！", "zh": "然后，亚美一个人去了之后，那个孩子就在那里等着哦～。\n不过细节就不能告诉你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "6dd18584f3549465372417b4b433e6845b848bd8220e4edde46967098ae15147", "ja": "そっか……なんだか、ドキドキするネ……。\nドラマみたいだヨ～。", "zh": "这样啊……总觉得心里怦怦直跳呢……\n简直就像电视剧一样～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "8abf5f8a4225c3d0b0a7e2ed7af52d7a8424d9ce6a646dfae4502b620c1d11e8", "ja": "それで、なんて答えたのっ？", "zh": "那你是怎么回答的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6d87523d25325f7e3c896344af2e717744f3e9292832ce277f8155a973f91a7", "ja": "返事は、まだしてないよ。\nその子も、待っててくれるって言ってたし。", "zh": "我还没回复呢。那孩子也说会等我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1025_p", "source_sha256": "22313f44f2c72abf2b5b6ad72acfc959c48203d737f49c62e6396fcc3a3025bc", "ja": "相手は、どんな子なんだ？\n亜美とは、普段から仲がいいのか？", "zh": "对方是个什么样的孩子？\n平时和亚美关系好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "07e7c58915db55fc40ff56afac09eb7af54627a89f86c6d8e8f17fdb8e4d3ec3", "ja": "おっ、兄ちゃん、気になる？　気になる？？", "zh": "哦，哥哥，你很在意吗？很在意吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d665b39e20c3e2d4408c2d3e0acc310626f7f21520da46fa8e96ab95b4cbf70d", "ja": "そりゃ、亜美のプロデューサーだし。\n当然気になるよ。", "zh": "那当然了，我可是亚美的制作人。  \n当然会在意啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "35b89e29292ef124067d8814dbbbc66e1b4e82a2981f0dbfe60901afc6773d6a", "ja": "で、でも、告白されても、お付き合いとか……\n中学生だし、ちょっと早いよね……？", "zh": "可、可是，就算被告白了，要交往什么的……\n毕竟还是初中生，现在是不是还有点早……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c3d06ed47efaf675a9b0b5fd67106f69b9bc05a7ec08e16becd7751d7c3c7bf", "ja": "ですよね……あ、でも、千鶴さんも中学生の時に\n告白されたって言ってたし、そんなものなのかな……？", "zh": "就是说嘛……啊，不过，千鹤说过她上初中时也有人向她告白，\n或许就是这样吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "1935c0058a87477c169bc5400bf7106e1ad14ca9aea5b8f1a6259e923ece80fb", "ja": "アミはその男の子のコト、気になってるノ？\nだから、返事を悩んでるとか？", "zh": "亚美对那个男生有意思吗？\n所以才会烦恼要怎么回复？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "597962eee4db95e3f1c62347a983a9c0178a11b5414219a443d10ed9772a3b89", "ja": "ううん、そういうんじゃないよ。\nクラスメイトだけど、フツーに友達って感じだし。", "zh": "不是那样的啦。\n虽然是同班同学，但就是普通朋友而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5c9fa63c121da7d59d599a1e9973b9faa3d7652372dbec60ab94efa4ce0a4154", "ja": "それなら、どうして返事を保留にしたんだ？", "zh": "既然这样，那你为什么要暂缓回复？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "59cf3bec5d49ec7e26b27afeb56a0bb46cfe069a3d70646571ffef35fcbbb0ed", "ja": "うん。亜美、付き合うとかそういうのは、\nまだ考えてないけど……。", "zh": "嗯。亚美虽然还没考虑过\n交往之类的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "e06e1718ee8660dadd3c10b6814a475241d15ed79b73f74c89b7a1610eeb3aef", "ja": "ただ、話してる時にちょこっと思い出したんだよね。\n新曲のコト……。", "zh": "不过，我只是聊天的时候稍微想起了一件事。\n关于新歌的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "62c81c9b68464f79e7f0ea2499152ed923df895177426a8ca3b2ce62fc29089b", "ja": "へ？　……ちょ、亜美！　まさかアンタ、新曲のために\nその子と付き合おうとか思ってないでしょうね！？", "zh": "诶？……等、等等，亚美！你该不会是想为了新歌，和那孩子交往吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "95e78df4c1862ba1efd6200adf10695c904eec55dad822396fc2253b621e54b4", "ja": "思うわけないっしょ！？\nただちょっと、参考になるかもって思っただけだし！", "zh": "怎么可能那么想嘛！？\n只是稍微觉得，或许能当作参考而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "2506c37c3b8518182a7dc891f275e1e07524d06256c450d01b5a078aab5c0b63", "ja": "似たようなものじゃない。\nそんなの不純だし、何より、不誠実だわ。", "zh": "不都是差不多的吗？\n那种做法太不纯粹了，更重要的是，也太不诚实了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "1d6242f089057259c05223cf7cb8d985a1a7784cb7413a541140f5189a0fe5cf", "ja": "それに……。つまりその子は、\nきちんと告白してきたってことでしょう？", "zh": "而且……也就是说，那孩子是认真来告白的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "b33ab07c080752a8756faa463a29baec82b3c631ff5022218effa2167c58cf7d", "ja": "真面目な気持ちを、仕事とか、\n別のことに結びつけるのは、よくないと思うわ。", "zh": "我觉得，不应该把认真的感情和工作之类的其他事情联系起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1040_011ami", "source_sha256": "5204226a70f8875f1b5f2f79fdd931b34fcb30031c57075c82cb704269133327", "ja": "うあうあ～！　非難ゴーゴーだよ～！\n兄ちゃんも、やっぱそう思う……？", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～！遭受到强烈谴责啦～！\n哥你也果然是这么想的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1041_p", "source_sha256": "5577564d3e328a7daa273617ee4f8265578e2d54561bc6a528d4f7b2d3daac69", "ja": "そうだな。亜美が、少しでもその子の事を\n好きなら、また話は変わるんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。如果亚美哪怕有一点喜欢那个孩子，情况就又不一样了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7866c4934784bf7f704fb7623b2f058967fbd3910a9954db6b4000ebd4eca862", "ja": "プロデューサーとして正直に言うなら……相手の恋心を\n利用する事も、成長するためにはありかもしれないな。", "zh": "作为制作人，老实说……利用对方的恋慕之心，或许也能成为成长的一种方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "21eb459df380bbe1f21085a389221d1e9b413a83e67f8bb139e176ec783c78bb", "ja": "ちょっと、アンタまで何言ってるのよ～！", "zh": "等等，你怎么也跟着说这种话呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "8b00e3aaa494b34e2719b239837bc8427b554b3dff33e8686d5d6e4bac8b7975", "ja": "{$P$}、本気で言ってるノ？\n相手の子が、かわいそうだヨ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你是认真的吗？\n对方那个女孩子，太可怜了呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1046_p", "source_sha256": "133f57e9afdc98805ab74a4f4109c01f672268192ff0dcc9b707cd4cfe5022e1", "ja": "そうだな、俺もかわいそうだと思う。\nでも、よく言うだろ？　『芸の肥やし』って。", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得她挺可怜的。\n不过，不是常说“经历都是艺术的养分”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f4da00270f13931ebd44ec85af36808116cdbdf7604e4133c6a7acbd7f38fd8a", "ja": "自分のために他人を利用する事もやぶさかではない。\n……そういう人だって、少なからずいるだろう。", "zh": "为了自己，利用他人也并非不可。\n……这样的人，多少还是有一些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1048_p", "source_sha256": "30a80471b61ff09e4e8aef90b31ddbb086438dd23b5887b89c59b44054c0f7ec", "ja": "でもそれは、その後の何もかもを、\n引き受ける覚悟があるから言えると思うんだ。", "zh": "但我觉得，只有做好承担那之后的一切的觉悟，才说得出这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1049_011ami", "source_sha256": "9b5e5bcef4c77b80f939074e4eca7da530384381860538d8c3925e4148ad3f2d", "ja": "覚悟……？", "zh": "觉悟……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1050_p", "source_sha256": "bf21bb4e73c2896c83aa7b05d32bfcfafba6df1291c952a2398706e526fbc9a8", "ja": "そうだ。傷付けられて苦しむのは、本人だけじゃない。\n傷付けた方にも、痕が残る。", "zh": "没错。受到伤害而痛苦的，不只是本人。\n伤害他人的一方，也会留下伤痕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1051_011ami", "source_sha256": "0959c25ad2d734f7ceaf45d49fc89360dc176010110fe9a59aa9ee5d75ad8e39", "ja": "痕が残る？　……亜美に？", "zh": "会留下痕迹？……在亚美身上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1052_p", "source_sha256": "a7922dfac2de82f5d54b5efd49da166cccc68dc2b9322821d994bc8d6cff28b7", "ja": "うん。……だから俺は、できればしてほしくない。\n勝手だけど、亜美に傷付いてほしくないから。", "zh": "嗯……所以如果可以的话，我不希望你这么做。\n虽然这么说很任性，但我不想让亜美受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1055_011ami", "source_sha256": "cbbbfce07014c77de7e426a4c905417b1f4a1173bc4b95f4e8dda86272b71035", "ja": "うん……わかったよ。わかんないけど、\n兄ちゃんがマジなのはわかった。", "zh": "嗯……知道了。虽然还是不太明白，但我明白哥哥是认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1056_011ami", "source_sha256": "8c1df3241768af4eac4b87d3d008fde150498dac32636690f5f24461313dabbb", "ja": "もともと、オッケーするつもりなかったから……。\nちゃんと断ってくるね。", "zh": "反正本来也没打算答应……\n亚美会好好去回绝掉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1057_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3aed1ec87771da672202a52b68836a8b5c9905fe169db2ef350127f34c423db4", "ja": "亜美ちゃん……うん。", "zh": "亚美……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1058_007ior", "source_sha256": "f0b3af392a0f8b049ec38543366200b66f1298ef025702bf28d7b805605fd33b", "ja": "もう……。あんまり心配させないでよね！", "zh": "真是的……别太让人担心了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1059_p", "source_sha256": "5eb90da7b74229ff1255e87897caef521b54d39d19916eb3b45deb5d5b763a55", "ja": "よかった。\n……それじゃ、レッスンを再開しようか！", "zh": "太好了。\n……那么，我们继续训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1060_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1061_011ami", "source_sha256": "93041ffec3fe2fbf2182757b4a7be214d63ee561f3fbfc6d57767c2cfd86fe61", "ja": "来てくれてありがと。\nあのさ、こないだの返事なんだけど……。", "zh": "谢谢你愿意来。\n那个，关于之前的答复……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1062_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1063_011ami", "source_sha256": "1c6bd1aa0662f5272796c392f62424bb9b21f2cf067fac617c35e6e0bfd29104", "ja": "ゴメンね。亜美、アイドルだから……\nやっぱそういうの、無理みたい。", "zh": "对不起。亚美是偶像嘛……\n果然，那种事好像还是做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1064_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "fb24d79b78813299dff5c9b9e1a38ffd8a92cc0984f7fc923098072eee8f58b0", "ja": "うん、そうだよね。\n……ゴメン、迷惑だったよね。", "zh": "嗯，也是呢。\n……抱歉，给你添麻烦了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1065_011ami", "source_sha256": "25d221c0dc098885100dc62566391454b387b088e31a5a8cd149e11eaa08abbd", "ja": "え？　亜美、迷惑とは思ってないよ。\nビックリはしたけど。", "zh": "诶？亚美没觉得麻烦哦。\n虽然确实吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1066_011ami", "source_sha256": "a38616ffb76f0a74b57fff971729eb94ee18187e6fcbecd9aa7d78529ddf0fcb", "ja": "でも、何でだったかは気になるかな～。\nもしかして……亜美が最近、せくしーすぎたせい？", "zh": "不过，我还是有点想知道为什么啦～。难道说……是因为亚美最近太性感了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1067_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "9f6e8bf0b7558a76c74b7fff7250639086ac395073f5482e274297397bad7b98", "ja": "セクシー……？　えっと、そうじゃなくて……\n双海さんが、いつも明るくて元気だからかな。", "zh": "性感……？呃，不是这样的……\n可能是因为双海小姐总是那么开朗又有活力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1068_011ami", "source_sha256": "1560104ab561156aad598ce47c6f869cbbd87eea2f5fdcf733555b072817aff2", "ja": "まあね～。どっちかっていうと、\n騒がしいって言われがちだけど！", "zh": "算是吧～。要说的话，大家更常说我吵吵闹闹的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1069_011ami", "source_sha256": "211fe6f50e8f59af770044e1f7e521e7cda7efe0630b24afcf854697ef34a441", "ja": "でも、これって亜美の取り柄だかんね！\nいーっぱいある長所のうちの、ひとつだし？", "zh": "不过，这也是亚美的优点嘛！\n毕竟是那么多优点中的一个，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1070_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "c9bc44e0dbacfe50fcaa16b576c75e0bf0e00feb1bb949618f7a65c24fc4d7b4", "ja": "うん、そうだね。双海さんには、\nそれが当たり前なのかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "嗯，也是呢。对双海同学来说，\n或许那已经是理所当然的事了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1071_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "df269f6dc60a48226709a8af87346689865842dde1523bb5fd554acc76063945", "ja": "僕、自分がつらかった時、君の何気ない\n言葉や笑顔に、救われたことがあったんだ。", "zh": "我曾在自己难受的时候，被你不经意的话语和笑容拯救过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_136_1072_danshiseito", "source_sha256": "9fdfc1d2d8d26d7f02e01150648432174b6f096dd841e7cb245b7486d016f1ab", "ja": "だから、困らせるかもしれないと思ったけど……\nちゃんと伝えないと、後悔すると思って。", "zh": "所以，虽然我想过这样可能会让你为难……  \n但如果不把话好好传达给你，我一定会后悔的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
